OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks and torch events
OL,4,Acancelled amid fire risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks displays and a torch
OL,7,Fprocession have been cancelled across
OL,8,Fthe south of England as a result of
OL,9,Fincreased fire risk caused by prolonged
OL,10,Fdry weather.
OL,12,FAbingdon International Fireworks
OL,13,FFestival, which was due to take place
OL,14,Fin Oxfordshire on 29 August, has been
OL,15,Fcancelled and rescheduled for 10 April
OL,16,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
