OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks and torch events
OL,4,Acancelled amid fire risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA torchlight procession in Bridport,
OL,7,FDorset, for the town's carnival on
OL,8,FSaturday has also been abandoned and
OL,9,FHampshire Air Festival said its
OL,10,Ffireworks display scheduled for 12
OL,11,FSeptember would no longer take place.
OL,13,FBerkshire and Oxfordshire fire services
OL,14,Fmeanwhile have asked people to stop
OL,15,Fusing 999 to report neighbours having
OL,16,Fbarbecues or bonfires and only use it
OL,17,Ffor emergencies.
